 "sentences": [
  "This Poet Laureate was called a \"head Dunce\".",
  "Colley Cibber was an English actor and playwright.",
  "He wrote 25 plays for Drury Lane.",
  "Critics hated his \"miserable mutilation\" of Shakespeare.",
  "He loved comical fop parts but failed at tragedy.",
  "Peers accused him of shady business and opportunism.",
  "His poetry is remembered only for being poor."
